{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06597","headline":"送丘健至州敕放作时任下邽县 · 储光羲","name":"送丘健至州敕放作时任下邽县","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太史登观台，天街耀旄头。\n大君忽霆震，诏爵冠军侯。\n南必梁孙源，西将圉崑丘。\n河陇徵击卒，虎符到我州。\n朝集咸林城，师言乱啁啾。\n杀气变木德，凛凛如高秋。\n元戎啓神皇，庙堂发嘉谋。\n息兵业稼穑，归马复休牛。\n和风开阴雪，大耀中天流。\n欢声殷河岳，涵荡非烟浮。\n邦牧新下车，德礼彼甿讴。\n乾坤日交泰，吾亦遂优游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06597.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06597","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}